        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>福国王夫人震怒欲逐之</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" id=\"MathJax-script\" async\n  src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mathjax/3.2.2/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background-color: #d9c9a3;\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 0px, rgba(0,0,0,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 3px);\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n    width: 750px;\n    height: 500px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    display: flex;\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    padding: 6px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .title-box {\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    text-orientation: upright;\n    border: 2px solid #6b1616;\n    background-color: #d9c9a3;\n    color: #6b1616;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    padding: 8px 6px;\n    margin-right: 6px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: center;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    height: 90%;\n    align-self: center;\n  }\n\n  .title-box.small {\n    font-size: 17px;\n  }\n\n  .content {\n    flex: 1;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 10px 20px 10px 10px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n  }\n\n  .content p {\n    margin: 6px 0 14px 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n\n  .content p.notice {\n    text-align: center;\n    text-indent: 0;\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"title-box\">福国王夫人震怒欲逐之</div>\n  <div class=\"title-box small\">国朝妻管严<br>疑有私生子</div>\n  <div class=\"content\">\n    <p>瞳孔地震！将王安石抬进孔庙的好女婿蔡卞近日疑似陷入私生子风波。蔡卞妻福国夫人王氏闻之震怒，欲除妾生子，因故生病。</p>\n    <p class=\"notice\">本消息来自翰林医官院药方笔录：</p>\n    <p>《香术散》：治妊娠五个月已后。常胸腹胀气刺满痛，或肠鸣，以至呕逆减食。此由喜怒忧虑过度、饮食失节之所致。蔡元度宠人有子，夫人怒，欲逐之，遂病。医官王师复处此方三服而愈，后用果验。</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
